abstract: "BenNevis is an End-to-End Automatic Speech Recognition (ASR) toolkit based on Differentiable Weighted Finite-State Transducer (DWFST) with flexible topology definition support. It is implemented with PyTorch and k2."
keywords:
  - "automatic speech recognition"
  - "ASR"
  - "WFST"
  - "k2"
  - "PyTorch"
  - "deep learning"
  - "differentiable weighted finite-state transducer"
